  "releaseNotes": "#  (2025-04-28)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Adjust `WasmShellEnableEmccProfiling` support (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/0d571512341c507e69744987f09e69b83d7ebb17)\n* Adjust HR for 17.12.4 and later (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/f5e43ca05262471f23054c7243e16b005a2acfaf)\n* Adjust support for linked assets (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/8942406db5c72db345645c9b29ace8001d8f459a)\n* Do not crash in case of a customized loader (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/9c804308815e24bba76c3b502d8a9af9c560b897)\n* don't prefix uno-assets path with the package folder for compatibility (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/f694113f1513c20213e90847eb8aa16fdeefb9f7)\n* Ensure explicit dependency for manifest generation (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/7ebbcd16ea52496d3dc0a1b22cdaf216e71b22a4)\n* list all assemblies (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/13b36791695260e86490f46788723ab5b0fea48d)\n* **res:** Fix invalid loading of satellite assemblies with WasmShellLoadAllSatelliteResources (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/280d8d6cb323df73b799c1d0ba741a0c1307949d)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* Add support for WasmShellNativeFileReference (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/cd0085d94da08fe6a10e3510d1eb42bb6cd4a5cf)\n* Add support generic wasm apps (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/50d66fde50c8270ba1e959740791b9b6d0f00695)",
